{"id":3408,"slug":"3408-typed-provide-inject-voi-injectionkey-best-practice","category":"Vue.js","subcategory":"Composition API","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Typed `provide` / `inject` với InjectionKey — best practice?","question_en":"Typed `provide` / `inject` with InjectionKey — best practice?","answer_vi":"Dùng `InjectionKey` để provide/inject type-safe, tránh string key collisions:\n\n```typescript\n// keys.ts — export typed keys\nimport type { InjectionKey, Ref } from 'vue'\n\nexport interface UserContext {\n  id: number\n  email: string\n  role: string\n}\n\nexport const userContextKey: InjectionKey<UserContext> = Symbol('userContext')\nexport const themeKey: InjectionKey<Ref<'light' | 'dark'>> = Symbol('theme')\n\n// Parent component\nimport { provide, ref } from 'vue'\nimport { userContextKey, themeKey } from './keys'\n\nconst theme = ref<'light' | 'dark'>('dark')\nprovide(themeKey, theme)\nprovide(userContextKey, { id: 1, email: 'user@test.com', role: 'admin' })\n\n// Child component — fully typed\nimport { inject } from 'vue'\nimport { themeKey, userContextKey } from './keys'\n\nconst theme = inject(themeKey)     // Ref<'light' | 'dark'> | undefined\nconst user = inject(userContextKey)  // UserContext | undefined\n\n// Với default value — loại bỏ undefined\nconst theme = inject(themeKey, ref('light'))  // Ref<'light' | 'dark'>\n```\n\nDùng `Symbol` làm key thay vì string để tránh naming collision trong large apps hoặc libraries","answer_en":"Use `InjectionKey` for type-safe provide/inject with no string collision:\n\n```typescript\n// keys.ts\nimport type { InjectionKey, Ref } from 'vue'\n\nexport const themeKey: InjectionKey<Ref<'light' | 'dark'>> = Symbol('theme')\nexport const userKey: InjectionKey<UserContext> = Symbol('user')\n\n// Parent\nconst theme = ref<'light' | 'dark'>('dark')\nprovide(themeKey, theme)\n\n// Child — fully typed, no string guessing\nconst theme = inject(themeKey)          // Ref<'light'|'dark'> | undefined\nconst theme = inject(themeKey, ref('light'))  // With default — no undefined\n```\n\nUse `Symbol` keys instead of strings to avoid naming collisions in large apps or libraries.","answer_html_vi":"<p>Dùng <code>InjectionKey</code> để provide/inject type-safe, tránh string key collisions:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// keys.ts — export typed keys\nimport type { InjectionKey, Ref } from 'vue'\n\nexport interface UserContext {\n  id: number\n  email: string\n  role: string\n}\n\nexport const userContextKey: InjectionKey&lt;UserContext&gt; = Symbol('userContext')\nexport const themeKey: InjectionKey&lt;Ref&lt;'light' | 'dark'&gt;&gt; = Symbol('theme')\n\n// Parent component\nimport { provide, ref } from 'vue'\nimport { userContextKey, themeKey } from './keys'\n\nconst theme = ref&lt;'light' | 'dark'&gt;('dark')\nprovide(themeKey, theme)\nprovide(userContextKey, { id: 1, email: 'user@test.com', role: 'admin' })\n\n// Child component — fully typed\nimport { inject } from 'vue'\nimport { themeKey, userContextKey } from './keys'\n\nconst theme = inject(themeKey)     // Ref&lt;'light' | 'dark'&gt; | undefined\nconst user = inject(userContextKey)  // UserContext | undefined\n\n// Với default value — loại bỏ undefined\nconst theme = inject(themeKey, ref('light'))  // Ref&lt;'light' | 'dark'&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// keys.ts — export typed keys</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">InjectionKey</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Ref</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">interface</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserContext</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">email</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">string</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">userContextKey</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">InjectionKey</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserContext</span>&gt; = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Symbol</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;userContext&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">themeKey</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">InjectionKey</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Ref</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;light&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;dark&#x27;</span>&gt;&gt; = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Symbol</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;theme&#x27;</span>)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Parent component</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { provide, ref } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { userContextKey, themeKey } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;./keys&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> theme = ref&lt;<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;light&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;dark&#x27;</span>&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;dark&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">provide</span>(themeKey, theme)\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">provide</span>(userContextKey, { <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">email</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;user@test.com&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;admin&#x27;</span> })\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Child component — fully typed</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { inject } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { themeKey, userContextKey } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;./keys&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> theme = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">inject</span>(themeKey)     <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Ref&lt;&#x27;light&#x27; | &#x27;dark&#x27;&gt; | undefined</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> user = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">inject</span>(userContextKey)  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// UserContext | undefined</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Với default value — loại bỏ undefined</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> theme = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">inject</span>(themeKey, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ref</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;light&#x27;</span>))  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Ref&lt;&#x27;light&#x27; | &#x27;dark&#x27;&gt;</span></code></pre></div><p>Dùng <code>Symbol</code> làm key thay vì string để tránh naming collision trong large apps hoặc libraries.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>Use <code>InjectionKey</code> for type-safe provide/inject with no string collision:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">typescript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// keys.ts\nimport type { InjectionKey, Ref } from 'vue'\n\nexport const themeKey: InjectionKey&lt;Ref&lt;'light' | 'dark'&gt;&gt; = Symbol('theme')\nexport const userKey: InjectionKey&lt;UserContext&gt; = Symbol('user')\n\n// Parent\nconst theme = ref&lt;'light' | 'dark'&gt;('dark')\nprovide(themeKey, theme)\n\n// Child — fully typed, no string guessing\nconst theme = inject(themeKey)          // Ref&lt;'light'|'dark'&gt; | undefined\nconst theme = inject(themeKey, ref('light'))  // With default — no undefined\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// keys.ts</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">type</span> { <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">InjectionKey</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Ref</span> } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">themeKey</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">InjectionKey</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Ref</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;light&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;dark&#x27;</span>&gt;&gt; = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Symbol</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;theme&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">userKey</span>: <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">InjectionKey</span>&lt;<span class=\"hljs-title class_\">UserContext</span>&gt; = <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Symbol</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;user&#x27;</span>)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Parent</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> theme = ref&lt;<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;light&#x27;</span> | <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;dark&#x27;</span>&gt;(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;dark&#x27;</span>)\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">provide</span>(themeKey, theme)\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Child — fully typed, no string guessing</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> theme = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">inject</span>(themeKey)          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Ref&lt;&#x27;light&#x27;|&#x27;dark&#x27;&gt; | undefined</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> theme = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">inject</span>(themeKey, <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ref</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;light&#x27;</span>))  <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// With default — no undefined</span></code></pre></div><p>Use <code>Symbol</code> keys instead of strings to avoid naming collisions in large apps or libraries.</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3213-composable-la-gi-so-sanh-voi-mixins","title":"Composable là gì? So sánh với Mixins?"},{"url":"/q/3214-lifecycle-hooks-trong-composition-api","title":"Lifecycle hooks trong Composition API?"},{"url":"/q/3215-provide-inject-la-gi-khi-nao-dung","title":"`provide` / `inject` là gì? Khi nào dùng?"},{"url":"/q/3216-defineprops-va-defineemits-trong-script-setup","title":"`defineProps` và `defineEmits` trong `<script setup>`?"},{"url":"/q/3200-vue-js-la-gi-khac-react-angular-the-nao","title":"Vue.js là gì? Khác React/Angular thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3201-options-api-vs-composition-api-khac-nhau-gi","title":"Options API vs Composition API — khác nhau gì?"},{"url":"/q/3202-script-setup-la-gi-loi-ich-so-voi-setup-thong-thuong","title":"`<script setup>` là gì? Lợi ích so với `setup()` thông thường?"},{"url":"/q/3204-single-file-component-sfc-la-gi","title":"Single File Component (SFC) là gì?"}]}